  - type: heading
    text: Responsive experience

  - type: prose
    paragraphs:
      - "The relaunch was designed to keep its personality across devices."
      - "That meant adapting motion, hierarchy, and composition without losing the atmosphere of the desktop version."
      - "The mobile experience still needed to feel immersive, not reduced."

