    caption: "Responsive experience."
    variant: bare
    aspect: "auto"

  - type: heading
    text: Outcome

  - type: prose
    paragraphs:
      - "The final site positioned Zytro with a much stronger visual identity."
      - "It felt more premium. More contemporary. More memorable."
      - "The relaunch was also recognized by Awwwards as a Nominee, which matched the level of visual ambition behind the project."